.mdx","Bootstrap identity and authentication","Prepare server trust and admission proofs for enroll and reenroll.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity",{"_65":257},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.mdx",{"_39":259,"_46":58,"_41":260,"_52":261,"_61":-7,"_12":262,"_63":263},"en:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx","Integrate the EST client","Prepare trust, send a CSR and check the identity you receive.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client",{"_65":264},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx",{"_39":266,"_46":58,"_41":267,"_52":268,"_61":-7,"_12":269,"_63":270},"en:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx","Renewal and recovery","Renew without losing the identity and recover devices according to their actual state.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery",{"_65":271},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx",{"_39":273,"_46":58,"_41":274,"_52":275,"_61":-7,"_12":276,"_63":277},"en:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx","Trust distribution and updates","Separate roots, intermediates and initial TLS trust when distributing or migrating certificates.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution",{"_65":278},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx",{"_39":280,"_46":58,"_41":281,"_52":282,"_61":-7,"_12":283,"_63":284},"en:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx","EST reference","Look up Lamassu routes, formats, authentication and multipart responses.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference",{"_65":285},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx",{"_39":287,"_46":58,"_41":288,"_52":289,"_61":-7,"_12":290,"_63":291},"en:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting.mdx","Enrollment troubleshooting","Locate transport, authentication, registration, issuance and installation failures.","/docs/pr-preview/pr